    "instructions": "Briefly recall the original request and link its Task details when available. Report only work actually performed, observed verification and remaining work. Do not imply completion without evidence. Use Fields for concise metadata and the titled Rich text objects for detailed content. Required Fields describe expected information; incomplete drafts may be saved. Ask for missing facts when needed; never invent people, dates, references or results. References identify sources and do not grant access. These Fields do not change Workmap execution state.",
